   242	
   243	The value-affecting external boundary is the supplied
   244	`sortKeyVS(ValSeq, Val)` primitive in
   245	`reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k`. Symbolic MPY intentionally leaves it
   246	opaque; `MPY-CONCRETE` executes stable key calls and insertion sorting for
   247	LLVM. `SPEC.get-row` depends on it only by returning the raw nested
   248	`sortKeyVS` term. Interpreting that term as correctly stable-sorted is
   249	conditional on the supplied contract.
